      "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T21:10:00+09:00",
      "masterCount": 0,
      "studyCount": 0,
      "lastStudiedAt": null,
      "lastStudyMode": null,
      "type": "short",
      "sourceSet": "derived"
    },
    {
      "text": "ビスマルクによるカトリック勢力への弾圧を【文化闘争】という。",
      "tags": [
        "No21",
        "第15章",
        "帝国主義",
        "ドイツ",
        "長文分解"
      ],
      "gradingMode": "loose",
