      "createdAt": "2026-11-02T20:54:00+09:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T21:10:00+09:00",
      "masterCount": 0,
      "studyCount": 0,
      "lastStudiedAt": null,
      "lastStudyMode": null,
      "sourceSet": "derived"
    },
    {
      "text": "南北戦争で北軍を率い、のちにアメリカ大統領となった人物は【グラント】である。",
      "tags": [
        "No21",
        "第13章",
        "南北戦争",
        "短文問題",
        "長文分解"
      ],
      "gradingMode": "loose",
      "type": "short",
      "id": "derived-ac3928396a252197",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-02T20:54:00+09:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T21:10:00+09:00",
      "masterCount": 0,
      "studyCount": 0,
      "lastStudiedAt": null,
      "lastStudyMode": null,
      "sourceSet": "derived"
    },
    {
      "text": "ゲティスバーグの戦いでは【北軍】が勝利した。",
      "tags": [
        "No21",
        "第13章",
        "南北戦争",
        "短文問題",
        "長文分解"
      ],
      "gradingMode": "loose",
      "type": "short",
      "id": "derived-a7c4eb7f48048633",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-02T20:54:00+09:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T21:10:00+09:00",
      "masterCount": 0,
      "studyCount": 0,
      "lastStudiedAt": null,
      "lastStudyMode": null,
      "sourceSet": "derived"
    },
    {
      "text": "リンカンは南北戦争終結後に【暗殺】された。",
      "tags": [
        "No21",
        "第13章",
        "南北戦争",
        "短文問題",
        "長文分解"
      ],
      "gradingMode": "loose",
      "type": "short",
      "id": "derived-8f2156db14967b18",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-02T20:54:00+09:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T21:10:00+09:00",
      "masterCount": 0,
      "studyCount": 0,
      "lastStudiedAt": null,
      "lastStudyMode": null,
      "sourceSet": "derived"
    },
    {
      "text": "南北戦争前、南部が主張した貿易政策は【自由貿易】である。",
      "tags": [
        "No21",
        "第13章",
        "南北戦争",
        "短文問題",
        "長文分解"
      ],
      "gradingMode": "loose",
      "type": "short",
      "id": "derived-644280b815150f1e",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-02T20:54:00+09:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T21:10:00+09:00",
      "masterCount": 0,
      "studyCount": 0,
      "lastStudiedAt": null,
      "lastStudyMode": null,
      "sourceSet": "derived"
    },
    {
      "text": "ビスマルクは社会主義者鎮圧法と並行して【社会政策】を実施した。",
      "tags": [
        "No21",
        "第15章",
        "帝国主義",
        "ドイツ",
        "短文問題",
        "長文分解"
      ],
      "gradingMode": "loose",
      "type": "short",
      "id": "derived-7f9fc5268c914a19",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-02T20:54:00+09:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T21:10:00+09:00",
      "masterCount": 0,
      "studyCount": 0,
      "lastStudiedAt": null,
      "lastStudyMode": null,
      "sourceSet": "derived"
    },
    {
      "text": "ダーウィンの【進化論】は自然科学を越えて社会にも大きな影響を与えた。",
      "tags": [
        "No21",
        "第15章",
        "帝国主義",
        "思想",
        "短文問題",
        "長文分解"
      ],
      "gradingMode": "loose",
      "type": "short",
      "id": "derived-a5652e3956c496ab",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-02T20:54:00+09:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T21:10:00+09:00",
      "masterCount": 0,
      "studyCount": 0,
      "lastStudiedAt": null,
      "lastStudyMode": null,
      "sourceSet": "derived"
    },
    {
      "text": "ブーランジェ事件が起きた当時のフランスは【第三共和政】であった。",
      "tags": [
        "No21",
        "第15章",
        "帝国主義",
        "フランス",
        "短文問題",
        "長文分解"
      ],
      "gradingMode": "loose",
      "type": "short",
